    "body": {
      "contentType": "html",
      "content": "<div><div>\n<div>\n\n<div itemprop=\"copy-paste-block\"><span style=\"font-size:small; text-align:start; text-indent:0px\"><span><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures:normal\"><span style=\"font-variant-caps:normal\"><span><span style=\"letter-spacing:normal\"><span><span style=\"text-transform:none\"><span style=\"white-space:normal\"><span style=\"widows:2\"><span style=\"word-spacing:0px\"><span style=\"background-color:#f0f2f4\"><span><span><span><span style=\"display:inline\"><span style=\"float:none\">Hi Harbour Team!</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>\n\n<div style=\"text-align:start; text-indent:0px\"><span style=\"font-size:small\"><span><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures:normal\"><span style=\"font-variant-caps:normal\"><span><span style=\"letter-spacing:normal\"><span><span style=\"text-transform:none\"><span style=\"white-space:normal\"><span style=\"widows:2\"><span style=\"word-spacing:0px\"><span style=\"background-color:#f0f2f4\"><span><span><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div>\n\n\n<div style=\"text-align:start; text-indent:0px\"><span style=\"font-size:small\"><span><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures:normal\"><span style=\"font-variant-caps:normal\"><span><span style=\"letter-spacing:normal\"><span><span style=\"text-transform:none\"><span style=\"white-space:normal\"><span style=\"widows:2\"><span style=\"word-spacing:0px\"><span style=\"background-color:#f0f2f4\"><span><span><span>We are so excited to be expanding&nbsp;to the EU/UK next year. We are targeting an April 2022 launch. We want to make sure that you account for additional capacity needs to support this expansion. Based on&nbsp;<b>newness</b>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<b>EU/UK</b>&nbsp;<wbr>assortment for next year, please confirm you can support<b>&nbsp;25%</b>&nbsp;<b>growth in capacity.</b>&nbsp;</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div>\n\n\n<div style=\"text-align:start; text-indent:0px\"><span style=\"font-size:small\"><span><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures:normal\"><span style=\"font-variant-caps:normal\"><span><span style=\"letter-spacing:normal\"><span><span style=\"text-transform:none\"><span style=\"white-space:normal\"><span style=\"widows:2\"><span style=\"word-spacing:0px\"><span style=\"background-color:#f0f2f4\"><span><span><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div>\n\n\n<div style=\"text-align:start; text-indent:0px\"><span style=\"font-size:small\"><span><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures:normal\"><span style=\"font-variant-caps:normal\"><span><span style=\"letter-spacing:normal\"><span><span style=\"text-transform:none\"><span style=\"white-space:normal\"><span style=\"widows:2\"><span style=\"word-spacing:0px\"><span style=\"background-color:#f0f2f4\"><span><span><span>In addition, resending the&nbsp;matrix for EU/UK testing requirements. All of these protocols are now available in ICIX.&nbsp;RH compliance team will be sending you requests through ICIX for SKUs&nbsp;that will need to be tested for new collections as well as carryover collections. Please note that all of our performance testing has been elevated to contract standards. If you have any questions with regards to test requests, please reach out to Levinia and Christina Hom.&nbsp;</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div>\n\n\n<div style=\"text-align:start; text-indent:0px\"><span style=\"font-size:small\"><span><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures:normal\"><span style=\"font-variant-caps:normal\"><span><span style=\"letter-spacing:normal\"><span><span style=\"text-transform:none\"><span style=\"white-space:normal\"><span style=\"widows:2\"><span style=\"word-spacing:0px\"><span style=\"background-color:#f0f2f4\"><span><span><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div>\n\n\n<div style=\"text-align:start; text-indent:0px\"><span style=\"font-size:small\"><span><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures:normal\"><span style=\"font-variant-caps:normal\"><span><span style=\"letter-spacing:normal\"><span><span style=\"text-transform:none\"><span style=\"white-space:normal\"><span style=\"widows:2\"><span style=\"word-spacing:0px\"><span style=\"background-color:#f0f2f4\"><span><span><span>We look forward to our partnership as we expand on this new journey!</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div>\n\n\n<div style=\"text-align:start; text-indent:0px\"><span style=\"font-size:small\"><span><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures:normal\"><span style=\"font-variant-caps:normal\"><span><span style=\"letter-spacing:normal\"><span><span style=\"text-transform:none\"><span style=\"white-space:normal\"><span style=\"widows:2\"><span style=\"word-spacing:0px\"><span style=\"background-color:#f0f2f4\"><span><span><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div>\n\n\n<div style=\"text-align:start; text-indent:0px\"><span style=\"font-size:small\"><span><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures:normal\"><span style=\"font-variant-caps:normal\"><span><span style=\"letter-spacing:normal\"><span><span style=\"text-transform:none\"><span style=\"white-space:normal\"><span style=\"widows:2\"><span style=\"word-spacing:0px\"><span style=\"background-color:#f0f2f4\"><span><span><span>renee</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div><attachment id=\"636d1696-5876-4a4a-a9f4-e75657797f56\"></attachment>"
